 terms, ICOT Free Software conditions, Okinawa Dictionary public-domain
 named-entity enrichments, and Google extras) is compiled into conversion
 data shipped with these binaries. Provenance matches
 src/data/dictionary_oss/README.txt and the top-level LICENSE. This is
 not a complete DFSG inventory of every Bazel-fetched build-time asset.


